WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.563 --> 00:00:05.563
(somber music)

00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:08.293
- I'm excited!

00:00:08.293 --> 00:00:10.361
- I don't want to do this.

00:00:10.361 --> 00:00:13.403
- I feel like I'm about
to get physically hurt.

00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:18.403
(somber music)

00:00:23.817 --> 00:00:26.837
- I'm hoping that my Latin
taste buds can take it.

00:00:26.837 --> 00:00:28.344
- I don't think it's gonna be as bad

00:00:28.344 --> 00:00:30.400
as people have told me before.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.035
- Oh, you're full of
crap, it's gonna be bad.

00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:33.824
- It smells good.

00:00:33.824 --> 00:00:35.055
- Yeah, I like the smell.
- It smells great.

00:00:35.055 --> 00:00:38.362
- It smells like dried prunes and farts.

00:00:38.362 --> 00:00:39.618
- So how big of a bite?

00:00:39.618 --> 00:00:42.241
- Wait...
- Oh my God, it got near me.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:44.493
- Ready?
- One, two, three.

00:00:46.815 --> 00:00:48.289
(banging)

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:49.079
- Child's play.

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:50.205
- Did I do it wrong or something?

00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:51.146
It's not that bad.

00:00:51.146 --> 00:00:52.563
- You don't feel that?

00:00:52.563 --> 00:00:53.908
(laughing)

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:56.544
- Oh no, I'm scared.
- Oh no.

00:00:56.544 --> 00:00:57.408
- Okay...

00:00:59.365 --> 00:01:00.722
- Oh, I feel it now.

00:01:00.722 --> 00:01:02.626
- Dude, this is so bad.

00:01:02.626 --> 00:01:04.624
- It feels like hornets
are stinging my mouth.

00:01:04.624 --> 00:01:05.302
- Chew it up.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.081
- Ow!

00:01:07.081 --> 00:01:09.205
- You have tissues, my nose
is about to start leaking.

00:01:09.205 --> 00:01:10.204
- Oh my God, I'm sweating.

00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:12.690
(screaming)

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:13.631
- Can I die?

00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:15.928
- This is my second Carolina Reaper.

00:01:15.928 --> 00:01:18.066
(screaming)

00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:19.482
- [Voiceover] It's stuck in my teeth.

00:01:19.482 --> 00:01:21.049
(screaming)

00:01:21.049 --> 00:01:22.801
- It only gets worse,
like it radiates pain.

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:25.391
- It tastes good, it's just
like, it doesn't go away.

00:01:25.391 --> 00:01:26.123
- It doesn't taste good.

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:27.422
- Are you crying? 'Cause I'm crying.

00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:30.244
- I feel like I did a line of like glass.

00:01:30.244 --> 00:01:32.787
- Would I ever have this again, maybe if I

00:01:32.787 --> 00:01:35.271
was about to die, and just
wanted it to go faster.

00:01:35.271 --> 00:01:37.129
- Someone just like (bleep) poking needles

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:38.325
in my (bleep) lip.

00:01:38.325 --> 00:01:39.752
- We were happier earlier.

00:01:39.752 --> 00:01:42.665
And now I'm on the verge of tears.

00:01:42.665 --> 00:01:45.488
- I feel like if I sneeze
it's gonna be like a dragon,

00:01:45.488 --> 00:01:46.892
like I'm fire-breathing.

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:50.538
- I am trying not to puke very hard.

00:01:50.538 --> 00:01:52.396
- But the thing is like
I'm slowly prepared for it,

00:01:52.396 --> 00:01:53.718
like I've had other stuff that just like

00:01:53.718 --> 00:01:55.053
hit me at the wrong time.

00:01:55.053 --> 00:01:57.921
- I wouldn't wish this on my worst enemy.

00:01:57.921 --> 00:02:00.952
- I would, this would be a
good one for your worst enemy.

00:02:00.952 --> 00:02:02.877
- I thought for a second I might die.

00:02:02.877 --> 00:02:05.572
Like for a split second
I was like, it's over.

00:02:05.572 --> 00:02:06.859
- [Voiceover] So what just happened?

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:10.832
- I just threw up a bunch,
this is the worst heartburn

00:02:10.832 --> 00:02:13.229
I've ever had in my life, by far.

